PlayPort: https://github.com/youcci/playport
Base commit: 9a0882dd0ffe48e467b59d58b12d81391df55ade
License: GPLv3. Includes protocol code ported from DiPlay by shihabal3amri,
https://github.com/shihabal3amri/DiPlay, and xcertplay by shilapi,
https://github.com/shilapi/xcertplay. See original file notices and README.upstream.md.

LinuxPlay: https://github.com/Roylyl/LinuxPlay
ZIP commit: 370c844a7675165cb4f682bb799992d1550afd74
native/linux-platform.py and tests/linux-platform.test.py were adapted from this
GPLv3 project. Only the Linux bridge and its tests were imported; no MFi identity
or upstream credentials were copied.

map2tesla: https://github.com/jixiexiaoge/map2tesla
The fragmented MP4 layout in web/src/mse.ts was adapted from the GPLv3
usb_carplay_player.html implementation. This does not copy the Android VPN
virtual-IP mechanism, which is not portable to this Linux device.

Carrot's BlueZ browser pairing implementation:
Reference source: /openpilot/selfdrive/carrot/bluetooth/bluez.py
native/bluez_client.py adapts the application-scoped agent and device operations.
Copyright (c) 2018, Comma.ai, Inc.; MIT notice retained in licenses/carrot-MIT.txt.
Carrot vehicle controls, HID mappings and radio boot flags are NOT imported.
The web broker reads only the fresh stationary/disengaged setup-state snapshot.

Runtime libraries retain their respective upstream licenses inside JARs.
DashPlay: https://github.com/yizhixiaoheigou/DashPlay (GPLv3).
The queued swipe endpoint and capture-loss handling in web/src/input.ts were
informed by patches/playport-touch-swipe.patch; original CommaPlay cleanup rules
and browser input tests are retained. NIOPlay and wheelplay browser/audio designs
were reviewed as references; their Android/Rust playback engines were not copied.
NIOPlay: https://github.com/kissggj123/NIOPlay.
native/Engine/protocol/getInfo.ts informed the complete bidirectional audio
declaration enabled through existing CommaPlay microphone/format support.
No NIOPlay native decoder, Android/Rust playback engine or source file was copied.
wheelplay: https://github.com/fython/wheelplay (GPLv3).
The guarded disableBluetooth/Wi-Fi iAP2 handoff in WirelessBootstrap.kt was
adapted from shared/.../orchestration/CarPlayController.kt. Only the owned RFCOMM
bootstrap transport is closed, not the Linux Bluetooth controller or Wi-Fi.
The optional separately downloaded OpenJDK runtime retains its complete
legal directory (GPLv2 with Classpath Exception and third-party notices).
Before distributing binaries, provide the complete corresponding source,
build scripts, notices and any applicable runtime source obligations.

